4
00:00:10.989 --> 00:00:14.749
Today we learn about Coping with Change. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.777 --> 00:00:19.227
Change. Say it with me. Change!

6
00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.310
Stress. Say it with me. Stress!

7
00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:33.376
Feelings. Say it with me. Feelings!

8
