16
00:01:32.204 --> 00:01:33.354
Feelings!

17
00:01:34.279 --> 00:01:39.518
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.568 --> 00:01:40.718
Exercise!

19
00:01:41.941 --> 00:01:48.219
Did you know? Keeping some daily routines the same can help you feel steady during big changes!

20
00:01:48.269 --> 00:01:50.220
